# React Frontend Conventions

## Components

- Functional components only -- no class components
- PascalCase folder + `.jsx` file per component; barrel `index.js` re-exports default
- Colocated `.css` file for styles; use Ant Design `theme.useToken()` for dynamic values

## Data Fetching

- Use hooks from `src/hooks/` for ALL API calls:
  - `useApiRequest` -- imperative mutations (submit, delete)
  - `useApiQuery` -- declarative data loading
  - `useApiMutation` -- form submissions with loading state
- Never import or call `axios` directly in components or pages

## UI Library

- Ant Design is the component library -- use `Button`, `Input`, `Table`, `Card`, `Form`, `Modal`, `Select`, etc.
- Do NOT use raw `<button>`, `<input>`, `<select>`, or `<table>` HTML elements
- Toast notifications: `react-hot-toast` (`toast.success` / `toast.error`)

## Constants

- Route paths: import from `src/constants/routes.js` (`ROUTES` object) -- no hardcoded path strings
- API URLs: import from `src/constants/apiEndpoints.js` (`API_ENDPOINTS`) -- no hardcoded URLs
- UI strings: use `useTranslation()` from `react-i18next`; keys in `src/i18n/locales/en.json`

## File Naming

- Pages/components: `PascalCase/PascalCase.jsx` + `PascalCase.css`
- Hooks: `camelCase.js` prefixed with `use`
- Utils/constants: `camelCase.js`
